Oliver Obi <oliver.obi@epost.de> wrote:
> I have a empty PDP11/23 box.
> Which Modules do i need to build a working system.
> (I have already a 8186 CPU and a 8043 serial module)

The main things you'll need are RAM and a disk controller.  Depending on the
model of M8186 you might also need a board with a bootstrap on it (a lot of
3rd party disk controllers have this).  Even if your CPU board doesn't have
a console port on it, you can use the M8043 for your console port.

You'll have better luck getting your PDP-11 questions answered in one of the
PDP-11 newsgroups, either alt.sys.pdp11 or vmsnet.pdp-11

			Zane



